sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant S as Server
  C->>S: REQUEST · callId 1 · open a session
  S-->>C: RESULT · callId 1 · CREDENTIAL OPAQUE: the token
  C->>S: REQUEST · callId 3
  S-->>C: RESULT · callId 3 · no block: nothing changed
  C->>S: REQUEST · callId 5 · subscribe
  S-->>C: RESULT · callId 5
  Note over S: session timeout expired
  S-->>C: FAILURE · callId 5 · SESSION_REQUIRED<br/>CREDENTIAL NONE: the session has ended
  Note over C,S: the connection stays, for another session
